@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@userId = 1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### Create a user; copy the returned id into userId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Taylor",
  "lastName": "Student",
  "email": "taylor@example.com",
  "graduationDate": "2027-05-15"
}

### Read a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### Replace editable user fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Taylor Updated",
  "lastName": "Student",
  "email": "taylor@example.com",
  "graduationDate": "2027-05-15"
}

### Delete the user (after cleaning up reminders and applications)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}

